# React + Express Docker Application

A full-stack web application built with **React, Vite, Node.js, Express.js, Nginx, Docker, and Docker Compose**. This project was used as part of my BuildLabs DevOps Internship to demonstrate version control, containerization, environment configuration, and deployment practices.

## Project Overview

The application consists of two main services:

* **Frontend:** React application built with Vite and served using Nginx.
* **Backend:** Node.js/Express API.

Both services run inside separate Docker containers and are managed using Docker Compose.

## Technologies Used

* Git
* GitHub
* Docker
* Docker Compose
* React
* Vite
* Node.js
* Express.js
* Nginx

## Application Architecture

```text
Browser
   |
   | Port 8080
   v
Frontend Container
React + Nginx
   |
   | API Request
   v
Backend Container
Node.js + Express
   |
   | Port 4000
   v
REST API
```

Docker Compose provides networking between the frontend and backend containers.

